						<string name="Text">The objective of the game is simple, make money and become the richest stock trader there is. To do this you must buy stocks at low prices and sell them at high prices. Open up the buy stocks GUI by clicking the button to the left of the screen.
To predict which stocks will go up and which will go down take a look at the news GUI. If something good happens to a game, it&apos;s stocks will go up. If something bad happens it&apos;s stocks will go down. Recieve insider information by buying the insider trading gamepass and clicking the insider information button on the news GUI.
Buy a better house using the real estate GUI.</string>
